      "en": "Temporary Portals Replace Boats and Zeppelins Due to Bugs",
      "es": "Portales temporales sustituyen a barcos y zepelines por bichos"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Temporary Portals Replace Boats and Zeppelins Due to Bugs...",
      "es": "Portales temporales sustituyen a barcos y zepelines por bichos..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aec6d899dcab2.46071937\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that portals have temporarily replaced some boats and zeppelins due to bugs.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2401777/15\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Hi There,<br><br>We are aware of some issues with transports such as boats and zeppelins becoming lost in the maelstrom for extended periods of time.<br><br>As a temporary fix, we’ve spawned portals near most transport docks or inside of the zeppelin towers to help you move between continents if your boat gets lost. We have a proper fix going out in the morning, and once we’ve verified that’s in and working, we’ll be removing those portals.<br><br>Hope this helps. Thank you!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that portals have temporarily replaced some boats and zeppelins due to bugs.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Hi There,<br /><br />We are aware of some issues with transports such as boats and zeppelins becoming lost in the maelstrom for extended periods of time.<br /><br />As a temporary fix, we’ve spawned portals near most transport docks or inside of the zeppelin towers to help you move between continents if your boat gets lost. We have a proper fix going out in the morning, and once we’ve verified that’s in and working, we’ll be removing those portals.<br /><br />Hope this helps. Thank you!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
