      "en": "Blizzard Aware of Population Issues in Certain Areas",
      "es": "Blizzard es consciente de los problemas de población en ciertas áreas"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Aware of Population Issues in Certain Areas...",
      "es": "Blizzard es consciente de los problemas de población en ciertas áreas..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aec6d002c9202.39324624\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that they are aware that certain areas are not feeling as populated as they should be and will be working on a fix tomorrow.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2401806/27\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Hi There,<br><br>Just wanted to chime in and say that we are aware of some issues with certain areas not feeling as populated as they should. We will be tweaking some numbers tomorrow to help things feel a bit more lively.<br><br>Thanks for the feedback on this one!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that they are aware that certain areas are not feeling as populated as they should be and will be working on a fix tomorrow. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Hi There,<br /><br />Just wanted to chime in and say that we are aware of some issues with certain areas not feeling as populated as they should. We will be tweaking some numbers tomorrow to help things feel a bit more lively.<br /><br />Thanks for the feedback on this one!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
