    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "The Great Outdoors Quest Bugged and How to Complete",
      "es": "The Great Outdoors Quest con micrófonos ocultos y cómo completarla"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "The Great Outdoors Quest Bugged and How to Complete...",
      "es": "The Great Outdoors Quest Bugged and How to Complete..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aec6dac34cde1.29530598\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The tutorial quest for camping, \"The Great Outdoors,\" is slightly bugged, but players can quickly work around it. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Camping Overview</span></a></div><br><br>WoW: Forever has a brand-new camping system and one of the first quests in the starting zones is <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=96101/the-great-outdoors\"><img alt=\"The Great Outdoors\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">The Great Outdoors</span></a>. This is a tutorial quest to teach you how to benefit from the camping system. This quest has two objectives:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Sit near the campfire</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Gain the Boosted Rest buff</div></li></ul>The \"Sit near the campfire\" objective appears to be a little bugged and doesn't trigger normally when you /<wbr>sit. However, if you /<wbr>sit while already /<wbr>sitting, this will complete the objective correctly. Once you wait for a full minute, you get a small Rested XP buff!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>The tutorial quest for camping, &quot;The Great Outdoors,&quot; is slightly bugged, but players can quickly work around it. <br /><br />Camping Overview<br /><br />WoW: Forever has a brand-new camping system and one of the first quests in the starting zones is <a href=\"/forever/quest=96101/the-great-outdoors\">The Great Outdoors</a>. This is a tutorial quest to teach you how to benefit from the camping system. This quest has two objectives: <br /><ul><li>Sit near the campfire</li><li>Gain the Boosted Rest buff</li></ul><br /><br />The &quot;Sit near the campfire&quot; objective appears to be a little bugged and doesn't trigger normally when you /sit. However, if you /sit while already /sitting, this will complete the objective correctly. Once you wait for a full minute, you get a small Rested XP buff!</noscript>            \n        ",
